{"Name":"Harrison Food Building","ShortName":"Harrison Food Building","Description":"Just minutes from Tai Seng MRT and major expressways, Harrison Food Building features seamless ramp-up access to all levels, wide driveways for smooth traffic flow, and dedicated loading bays for hassle-free operations. With private en-suite facilities and infrastructure built to support modern businesses, it offers both convenience and long term value in a rare freehold asset.","StartUrl":"/","Display":"standalone","BackgroundColor":"#ffffff","ThemeColor":"#041e42","Orientation":"portrait","Icons":[{"Src":"https://rtdbookappointment.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/Bookappointment/Property/44222efa-7f74-4afa-84dc-7ac3cea1af6a","Sizes":"192x192","Type":"image/png"},{"Src":"https://rtdbookappointment.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/Bookappointment/Property/44222efa-7f74-4afa-84dc-7ac3cea1af6a","Sizes":"512x512","Type":"image/png"}]}